        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to play as <strong>Trump</strong> or <strong>Biden</strong> and join the 2024 U.S. presidential election. Use cards to control swing states and secure electoral votes—once you exceed 270 votes, you win the election. You can simply allocate a card’s points to a state, or you can activate the card’s special effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Propaganda Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Border lockdowns, major hurricanes, political correctness—various event cards bring diverse effects! Every month, all placed propaganda cards are cleared from both sides, and a newspaper issue is published to recap all the propaganda events of the month。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Policy Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Policy card effects persist throughout the game! Different policy cards can be combined, and each combination offers a unique experience and can be the key to turning the tide of the campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conspiracy Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your conspiracy cards to delay and trigger special event effects. You can also try to uncover your opponent’s conspiracy cards. There’s always a surprise waiting for you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey! Join the election camp of your choice, experience the events of election year firsthand, and bring America to the outcome you desire!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to play as <strong>Trump</strong> or <strong>Biden</strong> and join the 2024 U.S. presidential election. Use cards to control swing states and secure electoral votes—once you exceed 270 votes, you win the election. You can simply allocate a card’s points to a state, or you can activate the card’s special effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Propaganda Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Border lockdowns, major hurricanes, political correctness—various event cards bring diverse effects! Every month, all placed propaganda cards are cleared from both sides, and a newspaper issue is published to recap all the propaganda events of the month。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Policy Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Policy card effects persist throughout the game! Different policy cards can be combined, and each combination offers a unique experience and can be the key to turning the tide of the campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conspiracy Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your conspiracy cards to delay and trigger special event effects. You can also try to uncover your opponent’s conspiracy cards. There’s always a surprise waiting for you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey! Join the election camp of your choice, experience the events of election year firsthand, and bring America to the outcome you desire!</p>",
